{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fYRSXXBVav1793229943.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>山東黃金因自產金產量及銷售量下降，截至九月底止季度轉盈為虧，蝕3.62億元人民幣，上一年度同期賺超過11.4億元人民幣。扣除非經常性損益虧損，3.31億元人民幣，上一年度同期賺超過11.3億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>期內收入升三成六，達到369億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T00:20:53.990456+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T23:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:15.761995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T00:18:13.140734+00:00","content_hash":"af3c97582fdd7ea1c520e917b7772b92f3924971ad85580cadc0623dc12cad06","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T00:20:53.990456+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}